  "notes": "Emphasizes totality — not just a change, but a complete replacement or refresh. Common in business, organizational, and personal contexts. The word {面目|めんもく}{一新|いっしん} (complete transformation of image/reputation) is a well-known set phrase.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {気分|きぶん}を{一新|いっしん}する: to refresh one's mood completely\n- メンバーを{一新|いっしん}する: to completely change the lineup\n- {面目|めんもく}{一新|いっしん}: dramatic transformation of one's image\n- {体制|たいせい}を{一新|いっしん}する: to overhaul the system\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {刷新|さっしん}: reform, overhaul — more formal, often for systems or organizations\n- リニューアル: renewal (loanword) — often for stores and websites\n- {改革|かいかく}: reform — broader, can be gradual",
